          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0045",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. But deliver us from evil.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0046",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. From the gates of hell",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0047",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Deliver their souls, O Lord.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0048",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. May they rest in peace.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0049",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0050",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. O Lord hear my prayer",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0051",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. And let my cry come unto you.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0052",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Let us pray,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0053",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "God, our Father, you grant pardon from sin and will the salvation of everyone. We beg you to be merciful and grant that all the deceased priests, brothers, sisters, relatives and benefactors of our community may come to eternal happiness through the intercession of the Blessed Virgin Mary and all your saints.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0054",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O God, the creator and redeemer of all the faithful grant to all your deceased servants the remission of all their sins, that they may obtain the pardon which they have ever wished for. We ask this through Christ our Lord. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0055",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Additional Collects for particular needs may be added here. After which continue here with the following:",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0056",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. We praise the Lord our God who has brought us together to rejoice in the Spirit.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0057",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. May we always be humble of heart and place our joy in the Lord. Let us not be carried away by any material success, but rather acknowledge that true happiness will be ours only when the things of this life have passed away.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0058",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "rubric",
          "source": "Hail Queen of Heaven – A Prayer for Protection",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0059",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Hail, Queen of Heaven",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0060",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. Mother of the King of Angels, O Mary, flower of virgins, Like a Rose or Lily, Pour out prayers to your Son, For the salvation of the faithful.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0061",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℣. Pray for us O holy Virgin of virgins,",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0062",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "℟. That we may be made worthy of the promises of Christ.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0063",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        },
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "Let us pray: Protect, O Lord, we pray, upon the intercession of Blessed Mary ever Virgin, this community of the servants of God from all misfortune: and graciously shield from the enemy all those who implore you from their heart. Through Christ our Lord. Amen.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            655,
            656
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              655,
              656
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-for-the-good-of-our-community-b0064",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prayer-in-honour-of-s-joseph",
      "title": "Prayer in Honour of S. Joseph",
      "sourceHeading": "Prayer in Honour of S. Joseph",
      "pages": [
        656
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O God, who in your ineffable providence have chosen S. Joseph as the spouse of your most holy mother, grant, we pray, that we may have him in heaven interceding for us whom we venerate as our Protector on earth. Through Christ our Lord.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            656
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              656
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-in-honour-of-s-joseph-b0001",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "prayer-in-honour-of-s-augustine",
      "title": "Prayer in Honour of S. Augustine",
      "sourceHeading": "Prayer in Honour of S. Augustine",
      "pages": [
        656
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prayer",
          "source": "O God, by revealing to our Holy Father, S. Augustine the secrets of your eternal wisdom, and by kindling in his heart the flames of divine love, you renewed in your Church the miracle of the cloud and fire; grant that under his guidance we may safely pass through the dangers of this world and be worthy to reach the eternal land of promise. Through Christ our Lord.",
          "english": null,
          "sourcePages": [
            656
          ],
          "translation": {
            "kind": "source-English",
            "sourcePages": [
              656
            ]
          },
          "alignment": "single-language",
          "id": "prayer-in-honour-of-s-augustine-b0001",
          "verification": "visual-review"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
